    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur se téléporte à l’aide d’un\npouvoir mystérieux. Il échange sa place\navec celle d’un allié sur le terrain.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user teleports using a strange\npower and switches its place with one of\nits allies.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user teleports using a strange\npower and switches its place with one of\nits allies.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かたい　つばさを　あいてに　たたきつけて\nこうげきする。じぶんの　ぼうぎょが\nあがることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단단한 날개를 상대에게 부딪쳐서\n공격한다. 자신의 방어가\n올라갈 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur frappe l’ennemi avec des ailes d’acier.\nPeut aussi augmenter la Défense du lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trifft das Ziel mit Stahlflügeln. Verteidigungs-Wert\ndes Anwenders steigt eventuell.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa carga contra el objetivo usando toda\nsu energía y en el turno siguiente tiene que\ndescansar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colpisce il nemico con ali d’acciaio.\nPuò anche aumentare la Difesa di chi la usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
